Sugrīva orders torch monkeys to rush Laṅkā at sunset --- Torch monkeys burn thousands of palaces and homes --- Freed elephants and horses spread chaos through Laṅkā --- Rāma and Lakṣmaṇa take bows and Rāma shatters city gate --- Sugrīva posts chiefs at gates threatening order breakers --- Enraged Rāvaṇa sends Kumbha and Nikumbha with Rākṣasa host --- Monkeys and Rākṣasas slaughter each other in night battle